    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74719" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρᾱμ-α</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
