			</span></i>, al. ; <i>sight, spectacle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.66
			</span></i> ; <i>vision</i> during sleep, <i>dream,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
